# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the image needs. Everything else (.env and other
# secrets, .venv, .git, tests, caches, coverage output, personal notes) never reaches the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!app/
!migrations/

# Bytecode compiled on the host; the image compiles its own.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
